WEBVTT


00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:01.400
hei what's up guys

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.601
so hari ni kita nak buat pandan Bun cheese cake

00:00:03.602 --> 00:00:05.121
yang ni bakar guna air fryer je

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.720
sangatlah sedap makan sejuk sejuk

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.240
dalam tu moist lagi okey

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:10.561
first ambil 250g/gr cream cheese

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:12.360
tambahkan setengah cawan gula

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:14.800
and then masukkan 1 kotak kecil whipping cream

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:17.920
2 biji telur and also 1 telur aa

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.920
tapi guna telur aku ni melekat pula kat cawan

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:21.040
tak tahu apa masalah dia

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:22.880
and then korang masukkan garam sikit

00:00:22.881 --> 00:00:25.241
lepas tu tambahkan 1 sudu kecil esen vanila

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.200
2 sudu tepung gandum

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:30.200
and also masukkan 3 per 4 Ti spoon

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:31.280
aa Ti spoon

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:33.880
ekstrak pandan and also sedikit pewarna hijau

00:00:34.120 --> 00:00:35.440
pewarna hijau jangan banyak dik aa

00:00:35.441 --> 00:00:36.641
nanti dia terang kau punya

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:38.400
cheesecake jadi macam trap fillet hijau nanti

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:39.560
okey korang blend semua

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:42.440
ambil loyang yang saiz 7in eh aa dia just nice

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:43.880
kalau besar sangat dia jadi lepek

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.480
kalau kecil sangat tak masak dalam cheesecake tu

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:47.320
aa masukkan dalam ni

00:00:47.321 --> 00:00:47.881
hentak hentak

00:00:47.882 --> 00:00:49.961
keluarkan buih buih yang nakal kat situ tu

00:00:49.962 --> 00:00:50.761
pecahkan semua

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:52.560
and then kita akan masukkan dalam air fryer

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:55.120
and bakar pada suhu 180°C

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:57.120
selama 20 minit

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:58.080
and bila siap

00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:00.120
tara aa tapi belum boleh makan lagi aa

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.880
kat tengah tu memang dia lembik lembik nyok nyok lagi

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:03.160
korang bagi dia rehat

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:05.160
tenang dalam peti sejuk selama berapa jam

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:07.040
baru boleh potong aa

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:08.880
walaupun kita rasa geram nak makan terus

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:10.600
kena sabar supaya dia sejuk dulu

00:01:10.601 --> 00:01:13.561
barulah sedap makan bersama family nanti okey

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:15.000
and then bau dia sangat sedap

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:16.520
ada rasa pandan wangi

00:01:16.521 --> 00:01:19.401
pandan tu and dalam tu masih lagi moist

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:21.880
yang ni korang boleh buat untuk moreh

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:24.120
ataupun open house raya ha

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:25.160
kalau tak boleh tunggu hari raya

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:27.240
boleh buat terus malam ni okey aa

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:28.880
selamat mencuba
